mine hook
  mine term, term hook
    take name
    mine maybe
      mine term, term note
        mine text
          take note
    mine list
      mine form, form hook-take
        take take
    mine maybe
      mine term, term task
        mine text
          take task

mine hook-take
  mine term, term take
    take name
    mine list
      mine form, form hook-take-lead
        take lead

mine hook-take-lead
